 ("floor plan", "n.", "平面圖", "The real estate agent showed us the floor plan of the second-floor office.", "房仲向我們展示了二樓辦公室的平面圖。"),
 ("follow up", "phr.", "後續追蹤、跟進", "I will follow up with the supplier tomorrow to confirm the delivery date.", "我明天會再聯絡供應商，確認交貨日期。"),
 ("foreclosure", "n.", "（抵押品的）法拍、取消贖回權", "The bank started foreclosure proceedings after the owner missed six mortgage payments.", "屋主連續六期未繳房貸後，銀行啟動了法拍程序。"),
 ("forgo", "v.", "放棄、捨棄", "Several executives agreed to forgo their bonuses to avoid staff layoffs.", "數位高層同意放棄獎金，以避免裁員。"),
 ("formality", "n.", "（例行）手續、形式", "The final interview is just a formality, since the team has already chosen her.", "最後一輪面試只是形式，因為團隊已經選定她了。"),
 ("forward", "v.", "轉寄、轉交", "Please forward this e-mail to anyone who could not attend the meeting.", "請將這封郵件轉寄給無法出席會議的人。"),
 ("freelance", "adj.", "自由接案的、特約的", "The magazine hires freelance photographers to cover overseas events and trade shows.", "這本雜誌聘請特約攝影師報導海外活動和商展。"),
 ("fringe benefit", "n.", "附加福利", "Fringe benefits include a company car, a gym membership, and paid parental leave.", "附加福利包括公司配車、健身房會籍和帶薪育嬰假。"),
 ("fundraiser", "n.", "募款活動", "The charity fundraiser raised over fifty thousand dollars for the children's hospital.", "這場慈善募款活動為兒童醫院募得超過五萬美元。"),
 # G
 ("garment", "n.", "衣服、服裝（單件）", "Each garment is inspected for defects before it is packed and shipped.", "每件衣服在包裝出貨前都會檢查瑕疵。"),
 ("generate", "v.", "產生、創造（營收）", "The new product line generated more revenue than expected in its first quarter.", "新產品線上市第一季創造的營收超出預期。"),
 ("glitch", "n.", "小故障、小毛病", "A software glitch caused some customers to be charged twice for their orders.", "一個軟體小故障導致部分顧客的訂單被重複扣款。"),
 ("go over", "phr.", "仔細檢查、複習", "Let's go over the budget figures one more time before the presentation.", "簡報前我們再把預算數字檢查一遍吧。"),
 ("grace period", "n.", "寬限期", "There is a ten-day grace period before a late fee is applied to your account.", "您的帳戶在加收滯納金前有十天的寬限期。"),
 ("gratuity", "n.", "小費、服務費", "A fifteen percent gratuity is automatically added for groups of eight or more.", "八人以上的團體將自動加收百分之十五的服務費。"),
 ("gross", "adj.", "總的、毛的（未扣除前）", "The company reported gross profits of three million dollars last year.", "公司公布去年的毛利為三百萬美元。"),
 ("guideline", "n.", "指導方針、準則", "All employees must follow the new guidelines for handling customer data.", "所有員工都必須遵守處理顧客資料的新準則。"),
 # H
 ("handout", "n.", "講義、（發放的）資料", "Copies of the handout will be distributed at the beginning of the workshop.", "研習會開始時會發放講義。"),
 ("hands-on", "adj.", "實作的、親身參與的", "The course provides hands-on training in operating the new packaging machines.", "這門課程提供操作新包裝機的實作訓練。"),
 ("headhunter", "n.", "獵人頭顧問、人才仲介", "A headhunter contacted him about a senior management position in Singapore.", "一位獵人頭顧問就新加坡的一個高階管理職位聯繫了他。"),
 ("headquarters", "n.", "總部", "The company will relocate its headquarters to Toronto next spring.", "公司明年春天將把總部遷至多倫多。"),
