 ("hectic", "adj.", "忙亂的、繁忙的", "December is always a hectic month for retailers and shipping companies.", "十二月對零售商和貨運公司來說一向是忙碌的月份。"),
 ("hereby", "adv.", "特此、藉此", "I hereby authorize my assistant to sign the delivery documents on my behalf.", "本人特此授權我的助理代我簽收送貨文件。"),
