 ("hold off", "phr.", "暫緩、延後", "We decided to hold off on hiring until the new budget is approved.", "我們決定暫緩招聘，等新預算核准後再說。"),
 # I
 ("implication", "n.", "影響、可能的後果", "Managers discussed the implications of the new tax law for the company's profits.", "主管們討論新稅法對公司獲利可能造成的影響。"),
 ("in accordance with", "phr.", "依照、按照", "All waste must be handled in accordance with federal safety standards.", "所有廢棄物都必須依照聯邦安全標準處理。"),
