 ("inadvertently", "adv.", "不慎、無意間", "The assistant inadvertently deleted several files from the shared folder.", "助理不慎從共用資料夾刪除了幾個檔案。"),
 ("inception", "n.", "創立、開端", "Since its inception in 2015, the startup has opened offices in six countries.", "這家新創公司自 2015 年創立以來，已在六個國家設立辦事處。"),
 ("inclusive", "adj.", "包含在內的；包容的", "The package price is inclusive of airfare, hotel accommodation, and daily breakfast.", "套裝價格包含機票、飯店住宿及每日早餐。"),
 ("inconvenience", "n.", "不便、麻煩", "We apologize for any inconvenience caused by the elevator maintenance this week.", "本週電梯維修若造成任何不便，敬請見諒。"),
 ("incumbent", "n.", "現任者", "The incumbent will remain in the position until a successor is appointed.", "現任者將留任該職位，直到繼任人選確定為止。"),
 ("indefinitely", "adv.", "無限期地", "The opening of the new branch has been postponed indefinitely due to permit delays.", "由於許可證遲遲未核發，新分行的開幕已無限期延後。"),
