 ("kiosk", "n.", "自助服務機；小亭", "Passengers can print their boarding passes at the self-service kiosks.", "旅客可在自助服務機列印登機證。"),
 ("knowledgeable", "adj.", "知識豐富的、內行的", "Our knowledgeable staff can help you choose the right laptop for your business.", "我們內行的員工能協助您挑選適合業務需求的筆電。"),
