 ("lengthy", "adj.", "冗長的、漫長的", "After lengthy negotiations, the union and management finally reached an agreement.", "經過漫長的協商，工會與資方終於達成協議。"),
 ("levy", "v.", "徵收（稅款、費用）", "The city will levy a small tax on hotel rooms to fund tourism promotion.", "市政府將對飯店客房課徵小額稅金，用於推廣觀光。"),
