 ("lodging", "n.", "住宿", "Lodging and meals will be provided for all participants in the training program.", "所有參加培訓課程的學員都將獲得住宿和餐點。"),
 ("loyalty", "n.", "忠誠（度）", "Our loyalty program rewards frequent shoppers with exclusive discounts and free shipping.", "我們的會員忠誠計畫以專屬折扣和免運費回饋常客。"),
